In this example, we first define the URL of the external API endpoint we want to connect to. We then initialize a cURL session using `curl_init()`. We set the URL of the API endpoint using `curl_setopt()` and also set `CURLOPT_RETURNTRANSFER` to true to ensure that the response is returned as a string.
Next, we execute the cURL session using `curl_exec()` and then close the session using `curl_close()`. Finally, we extract the relevant data from the response using `json_decode()`.
