To use XML data in a Java program, we can use libraries such as JAXB (Java Architecture for XML Binding) or DOM (Document Object Model). Here's an example of how to use JAXB to parse an XML file:
```
// XML file
<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<book>
  <title>Java Programming</title>
  <author>John Smith</author>
  <publisher>Acme Publishing</publisher>
</book>
